petal::route_file!(spec:petal::static_read_spec(),read:|_:&petal::Ctx|petal::read_json_value(&"Pump.fun Petal: list the latest and live coins under coins/, read one with coins/<mint>.json, see what the selected Bloom account holds in trade/<wallet>/<index>/holdings.json, then buy or sell. Every trade is one operation the owner approves in Bloom, capped at the SOL ceiling the approval shows and rebuilt with a fresh blockhash after it; there is no session key, no separate wallet, and no standing budget. Slippage is capped at 5%, sells are priced against the chain, and a sell of \"all\" closes the emptied token account. An empty token account can also be closed on its own, returning its rent to the same account."));
